The mod adds a single mouse click to discard.

Tired of opening context menus every time you want to discard foraged items? This mod lets you quickly discard forage icons with a single mouse click, saving you time and making foraging more efficient.

[h2]Motivation[/h2]

The vanilla foraging context menu looks overwhelming when I only needed the discard action. Since foraged items are automatically added to your active container, there's no value in selecting containers through the context menu. I loved the concept of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3571757687]Forage Icon Extension[/url], hovewer I found that interacting with the entire icon is much easier than aiming for a tiny discard button, especially when zoomed out.

[h2]Key Features[/h2]

[list]
[*]One-Click Discard: Discard foraged items instantly with a single mouse button press (Right Mouse Button by default)
[*]Fully Customizable Controls: Configure both discard and context menu buttons independently. Choose from Right Mouse Button, Middle Mouse Button, or Side Buttons (MB4/MB5)
[*]Optional Item Tooltips: item name tooltips on hover
[*]Context Menu Still Available: reasign context menu on a different mouse button (Middle Mouse Button by default)
[*]Translates: CN, DA, DE, EN, ES, FR, HU, IT, JP, KO, PL, PTBR, RU, TH, TR, UA
[/list]


[h2]Mod Options[/h2]

You can customize the behavior of this mod via mod options: Menu / Options / Mods / Quick Forage Icon Discard.

[h3]Available Options[/h3]
[list]
[*]Discard Button: Choose which mouse button performs quick discard (Default: Right Mouse Button)
[*]Context Menu Button: Choose which mouse button opens the context menu (Default: Middle Mouse Button)
[*]Show Item Tooltip: Toggle item name tooltips when hovering over forage icons (Default: Enabled)
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Build 42.12+
[*]Safe to add/remove mid-game
[*]Minimal vanilla code patched for better compatibility and stability
[*]Works well in pair with [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3507997225]Foraging Tooltip Extended [B42][/url] if you prefer the closest vanilla foraging experience while levelling up the skill
[*]May conflict only with mods which have custom forage icon interactions (none known at this time)
[/list]

[h2]Known Issues & Limitations[/h2]
[list]
[*]You can't assign the same mouse button for both discard and context menu actions (only Discard button will be active)
[/list]

[h2]Feedback[/h2]
Found a bug or have suggestions? Leave a comment! I'd love to hear your thoughts and improve the mod further